# Custom entity aliases for triage/trends normalization.
#
# Copy this file to entity_aliases.yaml (gitignored) and add entries to
# extend or override the built-in defaults in triage.py without editing
# code. Keys and values are matched/produced after lowercasing and
# stripping periods (e.g. "U.S." -> "us").
#
# Example:
# us: united states
# usa: united states
# idf: israel defense forces
